{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415669","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415669","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041566901:1":{"text":"棍棒が古くなったな。","source_cn":"这根棍子有点旧了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC917182A78692CCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566902:1":{"text":"どれどれ……ふむ、先端の摩耗が激しい。これ以上力を込めれば、いずれ折れてしまうだろう。","source_cn":"我看看……确实，顶端磨损得有些厉害，这里再用力就会断了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DD0F73C9A1B8737","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566903:1":{"text":"これは、お主が自らこしらえたのか？","source_cn":"这是你自己处理的木棍吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA5433A9FF2C41D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566904:1":{"text":"ああ。ちょうどいい棒があったから、磨いて使ってるんだ。","source_cn":"嗯，恰好捡了一根顺手的，打磨了下就直接用了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC79FFFCB7505854","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566905:1":{"text":"砂漠の木は木目が粗くなりがちだ。加えて乾燥した気候ゆえ、柔軟さに欠ける。","source_cn":"沙漠里的树，木质普遍疏松些，加上气候干燥，韧性就差点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0D970D481E63AB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566906:1":{"text":"拙者の保護油を分けてやろう。次に棒を拾ったら、言うとおりに処理を行えば、より長持ちするはずだ。","source_cn":"我分你一些保养油，你再捡到木棍，照我说的预处理一次，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0316B38A212BD0D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566907:1":{"text":"あんたのその……木の棒？それも使いやすそうだな。","source_cn":"你用的这根……木棍，看起来就很顺手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CF022933F40E52D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566908:1":{"text":"これは竹と言ってな。拙者の故郷では珍しくない植物だ。今はこの辺でも栽培されておるぞ。","source_cn":"这是竹子，我故乡常见的植物，如今在这边也有种植了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDFC2B322CEB8390","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566909:1":{"text":"竹は適した土地さえあればすぐに育つのが利点だが、その「適した土地」がなかなか見つからんのが難点でな。","source_cn":"优点是只要找到合适的地方，那它长得快又易得，缺点就是很...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB76E2B79B4DE314","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566910:1":{"text":"試してみるか？竹は中が空洞ゆえ、お主が使っている棒とは重心の感覚が違うぞ。","source_cn":"你要试试吗？它是中空的，和你平时用的重心不同。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC7856E634411D4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566911:1":{"text":"ああ……なるほど、独特な感触だな。","source_cn":"我试试……嗯，很特别的手感。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC1FB09F3C58877C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041566912:1":{"text":"これは拙者の身長と握り癖に合わせて削ったもの。長さも太さもお主には合わぬであろう。","source_cn":"这根是我按自己的身高和握持方式打磨的，长度和粗细都不适合你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD964E85279CA31C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041566913:1":{"text":"次来るとき、お主に合った竹を用意しておこう。","source_cn":"下次我过来，给你带一根适合你的吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16C4894D817793CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041566914:1":{"text":"それはありがたい。遠慮なく使わせてもらうよ。","source_cn":"多谢，我就不客气了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC0A3F43D656AB47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"ソーン","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:潘":{"text":"パン","source":"潘","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":2}}